The keyword-spotter classes under app/src/main/java/com/k2fsa/sherpa/onnx
are a minimal copy of sherpa-onnx 1.13.8 (Apache License 2.0).
Copyright 2024 Xiaomi Corporation. Field names match the JNI library.

The native libraries libsherpa-onnx-jni.so and libonnxruntime.so are
downloaded at build time from the sherpa-onnx v1.13.8 Android archive.
They are not committed. ONNX Runtime keeps its own license.

The phoneme model sherpa-onnx-kws-zipformer-zh-en-3M-2025-12-20 is
downloaded on the phone the first time listening starts. It is not
in this repository.
